WEBVTT

00:00:00.053 --> 00:00:06.803
Communication privacy and service interfaces 6 Communication and decisions

00:00:07.737 --> 00:00:10.710
A short alignment conversation takes place at a time

00:00:10.737 --> 00:00:14.710
agreed for the working day Routine tasks are recorded

00:00:14.762 --> 00:00:19.395
in the approved task system Material instructions given verbally

00:00:19.447 --> 00:00:24.092
are captured in the appropriate record Daniel distinguishes receipt

00:00:24.434 --> 00:00:29.276
approval and completion in status messages A sensitive matter

00:00:29.355 --> 00:00:33.513
uses a restricted channel Silence or a message read

00:00:33.553 --> 00:00:35.947
receipt is not treated as approval of a new

00:00:36.013 --> 00:00:43.342
commitment 7 Changes and protective interfaces Daniel identifies which

00:00:43.395 --> 00:00:48.355
changes affect the programme transport venue or support arrangements

00:00:49.276 --> 00:00:54.395
Lindiwe decides the business preference within her authority Thandi

00:00:54.724 --> 00:00:59.473
the EPO owns the required protective input The remote

00:00:59.539 --> 00:01:03.012
control room accepts the relevant monitoring assignment under its

00:01:03.065 --> 00:01:08.342
actual mandate Daniel maintains the administrative status and escalates

00:01:08.408 --> 00:01:12.776
unaccepted or uncovered activity None of these parties is

00:01:12.816 --> 00:01:18.513
recorded as having approved another party's decision 8 Confidentiality

00:01:18.566 --> 00:01:22.855
and family or personal tasks Daniel uses only the

00:01:22.882 --> 00:01:26.645
information needed for the authorised task and limits distribution

00:01:26.671 --> 00:01:31.013
to appropriate recipients In the fictional scope he may

00:01:31.079 --> 00:01:35.421
coordinate agreed personal appointments or family administrative contact where

00:01:35.474 --> 00:01:39.553
the necessary permission and time have been established He

00:01:39.553 --> 00:01:43.829
is not the household investigator family dispute mediator or

00:01:43.855 --> 00:01:49.302
automatic incident spokesperson New personal tasks are considered against

00:01:49.315 --> 00:01:54.065
scope privacy resources and competing business work before being

00:01:54.105 --> 00:01:54.749
accepted
